OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after police injured
OL,4,Ain e-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a police
OL,7,Fofficer was injured when stopping an
OL,8,Fe-bike.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, officers on Wallasey Road,
OL,11,FWirral, saw two men on an e-bike riding
OL,12,Fin an anti-social manner, according to
OL,13,FMerseyside Police.
OL,15,FWhen they saw police approaching, one
OL,16,Fof the men is said to have attempted to
OL,17,Fflee on the bike, but crashed into an
OL,18,Fofficer, causing arm and leg injuries.
